	(text "LCD VCI: 3.0-3.6 V; touch: 3.3 V nominal.\nDrawing specifies touch 2.8-3.3 V: confirm tolerance.\nLCD and touch currents are TBD: measure host load.\nRESX/ILI2130 timing not specified sufficiently in panel PDF."
