	(text "Host LCD 3.3 V and host touch 3.3 V\nremain distinct input nets.\n\nJ4.1: PC6 PWM from CN12.6.\nJ4.2: PB12 touch reset from CN12.12.\nJ4.3: GND from CN12.2.\nTP_INT: PJ5 from CN2.\n\nPower symbols retain original rail names."
